:Namespace Service
⍝ Routes and server settings. Stark maps each route to a handler in Api.

    ∇ Start;router
      #.Db.Connect
      router←#.Stark.New ()
      router.Handlers←#.Api
      router.Info←(title:'Issues' ⋄ version:'1.0.0')
      router.OnFailFn←'FailBody'
      router.OnErrorFn←'ServerError'
      router.ThreadMode←1
      router.Register Routes
      router.Start 8080
    ∇

    ∇ r←Routes
      r←[
        'GET'     '/health'          'Health'
        'GET'     '/labels'          'ListLabels'
        'POST'    '/labels'          'CreateLabel'
        'GET'     '/labels/{name}'   'GetLabel'
        'PATCH'   '/labels/{name}'   'UpdateLabel'
        'DELETE'  '/labels/{name}'   'DeleteLabel'
      ]
    ∇

:EndNamespace
